# _headers = Security Headers Policy
#
# @summary
# Hardening headers applied to every response. The site has no backend or
# accounts and loads no third-party code: every script, style, font, and
# image is self-hosted, its links to the places' own sites and maps only
# navigate away, and its one form posts to the site itself, where Netlify
# Forms picks it up. That lets the Content-Security-Policy be strict rather
# than needing broad allowances.
#
# default-src 'self' is the fallback every unlisted fetch directive inherits,
# so connect-src (the form's post), font-src, img-src, and manifest-src need
# no lines of their own, and img-src never allows data: URLs, since Vite
# inlines nothing. The directives listed either need a different value than
# 'self' (frame-src, object-src), are never covered by default-src at all
# (base-uri, form-action, frame-ancestors), or just state the default for
# clarity (script-src, style-src). style-src needs no 'unsafe-inline': the
# build ships no inline styles, and React sets its few dynamic styles through
# the DOM, which the policy doesn't restrict.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security keeps browsers on HTTPS for two years across
# every subdomain, leaving out preload, which commits the domain to the
# browsers' built-in HTTPS list and is slow to undo. Referrer-Policy is
# strict-origin-when-cross-origin, so the places the guide links to see the
# visits it sends them as coming from this site, never a page's full
# address. Permissions-Policy turns off the powerful browser features the
# site has no use for.
#
# @author z4nta0 <https://github.com/z4nta0>

# What: Security Headers Rule. Why: Every response should refuse framing, sniffing, plain HTTP, unused browser features, and anything loaded from another origin. How: This applies the Content-Security-Policy, the permissions and referrer policies, HSTS, a nosniff content type, and a deny on framing to every path.
/*
	Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'
	Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), idle-detection=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), picture-in-picture=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), serial=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
	Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
	Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
	X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
	X-Frame-Options: DENY
